# Minimal ESP32-S31 bring-up inittab: interactive shell on the console.
# Run rcS so networking, DHCP, NTP, and the normal Buildroot services start.
# / is a read-only cramfs from the flash XIP window (root=mtd:rootfs) — no
# remount,rw. mount -a brings up the fstab mounts (proc, sysfs, and the tmpfs
# for /tmp + /run); the skeleton's /var/* symlinks point into those tmpfs.
# /dev is a kernel-mounted devtmpfs (CONFIG_DEVTMPFS_MOUNT); no /dev/pts or
# /dev/shm needed (no pty/POSIX-shm clients in this rootfs).
::sysinit:/bin/mount -a
::sysinit:/etc/init.d/rcS
console::respawn:/sbin/getty -n -l /bin/sh 115200 ttyS0 vt100
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/bin/umount -a -r
